#| msgid "Hold down &Ctrl; while dragging the mouse. This will allow you to define a rectangle in the map. When you release the mouse button, the display will zoom to match the rectangle."
msgid "Hold down **Ctrl** while dragging the mouse. This will allow you to define a rectangle in the map. When you release the mouse button, the display will zoom to match the rectangle."
msgstr "Mantén premido &Ctrl; mentres arrastras o rato. Isto permite definir un rectángulo no mapa. Ao soltar o botón do rato o visor amplíase para coincidir co rectángulo."

#. +> trunk5
